# Bloodmoon "The Frostmoth Smugglers": Captain Falx Carius believes weapons
# are being smuggled out of Fort Frostmoth. With Gaea Artoria as partner the
# player questions the garrison and the armorer, finds the smugglers' den in
# Gandrung Caverns and, with Gaea at their side, fights Gualtierus Spurius's
# band; back at the fort, werewolves have struck and Carius is gone.
# PositionCell and Position stand in for the walks and kills stand in for the
# fight; ref FormIDs carry Bloodmoon.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from bm_smugglers
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case bm_smugglers
run
player->PositionCell 4095 3800 15124 0 "Fort Frostmoth, Carius' Chambers"
until 600 GetPCCell "Fort Frostmoth, Carius' Chambers" == 1
talk falx carius
ask fort business
ask weapons being smuggled
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Smugglers == 10
ask bit of help
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Smugglers == 20
bye
run
player->PositionCell 5286 4150 12791 0 "Fort Frostmoth, General Quarters, Upper Level"
until 600 GetPCCell "Fort Frostmoth, General Quarters, Upper Level" == 1
talk gaea artoria
ask assist you
choose 3
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Smugglers == 35
ask weapons being smuggled
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Smugglers == 45
bye
run
player->Position -173771 143037 908 0
until 600 "vilbia herennia"->GetDistance player < 400
talk vilbia herennia
ask weapons being smuggled
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Smugglers == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell -237 400 -106 0 "Fort Frostmoth, Armory"
until 600 GetPCCell "Fort Frostmoth, Armory" == 1
talk zeno faustus
ask weapons being smuggled
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Smugglers >= 65
bye
run
player->PositionCell 3972 5050 14334 0 "Solstheim, Gandrung Caverns"
until 600 GetJournalIndex BM_Smugglers == 80
run
player->PositionCell 10103 9100 13331 0 "Solstheim, Gandrung Caverns"
until 600 "gualtierus spurius"->GetDistance player < 400
console 06A7B095.kill
console 06BD6006.kill
console 06BBB8D6.kill
console 06A4CCDF.kill
console 066645AD.kill
until 600 GetJournalIndex BM_Smugglers == 97
run
player->Position -173703 141150 1047 180
until 900 GetJournalIndex BM_Smugglers == 100
end

# Back at the fort Gaea Artoria finds it attacked; Saenus Lusius sends the
# player to the Skaal village with a Skaal skull as a token; Tharsten
# Heart-Fang tells of the attack, takes the skull, and sets the Test of
# Loyalty: restore the six standing stones, as Korst explains.
case bm_carius
until 600 GetJournalIndex BM_Smugglers == 100
until 600 MenuMode == 1
bye
run
player->PositionCell -1451 -100 -111 0 "Fort Frostmoth, General Quarters"
until 600 GetPCCell "Fort Frostmoth, General Quarters" == 1
talk saenus lusius
ask find the Captain
expect GetJournalIndex BM_CariusGone == 10
ask Nord village
expect GetJournalIndex BM_CariusGone == 25
bye
run
player->PositionCell -27 -20 -244 180 "Skaal Village, The Greathall"
until 600 GetPCCell "Skaal Village, The Greathall" == 1
talk tharsten heart-fang
ask attack on the Imperial fort
expect GetJournalIndex BM_CariusGone == 100
ask your business here
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Stones == 10
ask much to atone for
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Stones == 20
ask defiled these lands
ask restore the power of the Skaal
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Stones == 30
bye
run
player->PositionCell 0 100 -216 180 "Skaal Village, Shaman's Hut"
until 600 GetPCCell "Skaal Village, Shaman's Hut" == 1
talk korst wind-eye
ask restore the power of the Skaal
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Stones == 40
ask Ritual of the Gifts
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Stones == 50
bye
end
